        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A shrine on the outskirts of Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Ending No.17 — Boring Peace$>"
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<$Next time, try to aim for a No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's good there's nothing happening, though.\""
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >\"Nothing is happening...?"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, is that really true?"
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's right, there was something inside a pyramid, and I fought..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Fought? Huh? So there really was something?\""
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >\"It's so strange..."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Gensokyo can't possibly be this boring."
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I feel like I've forgotten something important.\""
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The impurity flowing into the pyramid was all cleansed thanks to the power of that eerie goddess."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seemed like Gensokyo had returned to its unchanging everyday life."
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That was, until Reimu remembered the incident, and challenged the Sanctuary once more."
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >\"...Ahh, I'm so boored..."
            ]
        }
